    "preamble": "Kuldeep Singh Khaira vs State Of Punjab & Ors on 12 April, 2016 -1- Cwp No.1209 of 2014 In The High Court Of Punjab And Haryana At Chandigarh Cwp No.1209 of 2014 Date of decision: 12.04.2016",
    "facts": "At this stage, learned counsel for the State submits that Government of Punjab, Department of Health and Family Welfare vide notification dated 31.03.2016 has already framed the Rules known as \"Punjab Food and Drug Administration (Technical Group-A) Service Rules, 2016\" wherein qualification in consonance with the provisions of the Act has been laid down. In view of this, present petition is dismissed as infructuous.",
